      "content": "exactly. it's like there's this massive gap between what people are actually seeing happen in the real world and what the news tells them is happening. \n\nit feels like if you start questioning the official stories on things like economic shifts or even international conflicts, you're immediately labeled as a conspiracy theorist. given that, wouldn't you say that the core of this \"awakening\" is actually people finally reclaiming the truth that the mainstream media has been suppressing?",
